      { id=536, name="Yor", order=3,
        uiMapID=272, x=0.3566, y=0.6086, rootSection=5194,
        desc="A \"gift\" from Illidan Stormrage to accompany Nexus-Prince Shaffar, Yor is a void hound of unlimited savagery and power.  The prince's advisors warned him that Illidan's demonic gift was most likely a ruse set to betray Shaffar once he had met his goals. The prince fed those advisors to Yor... but has since kept the hound in a stasis chamber, just in case.",
