            body="Murmur touches a player, causing the air around them to pulse with sonic energy for $38794d, pulling all other players towards them. When Murmur's Touch fades, a shockwave of energy inflicts $33686s2 Nature damage and silences all players within $33686A1 yards of the player that was touched for $33686d." },
          { id=5276, title="Sonic Shock", parent=0, child=0, sib=5277, order=5, spell=0, icon="Interface\\icons\\spell_arcane_arcane03", flags=2, cdisp=0,
            body="Murmur shocks a player, inflicting $38797s1 Arcane damage to his current target." },
