            body="Warbringer O'mrogg ignites his maul, inflicting $36057s1 additional Fire damage to all players near his target with each melee attack for $36056d." },
          { id=5897, title="Blast Wave", parent=0, child=0, sib=0, order=5, spell=0, icon="Interface\\icons\\spell_holy_excorcism_02", flags=0, cdisp=0,
            body="Warbringer O'mrogg unleashes a wave of flame, inflicting $30600s1 Fire damage to nearby players and reducing their movement speed by $30600s2% for $30600d." },
        },
      },
      { id=569, name="Warchief Kargath Bladefist", order=4,
        uiMapID=246, x=0.6735, y=0.5451, rootSection=5898,
        desc="Chieftain of the Shattered Hand clan and warchief of the Fel Horde, Kargath is one of the greatest orcish heroes in recent memory. Over the years, he has severed both of his hands and replaced them with weapons of war, a bloody ritual unique to his clan. The joy he derives from inflicting pain on both others and himself is legendary among the orcs. As the Fel Horde's tyrannical ruler, he has channeled his ruthlessness and ferocity into forging an unstoppable army within the iron walls of Hellfire Citadel.",
        creatures = { {display=19799, file=607812, name="Warchief Kargath Bladefist"} },
