            body="Ghaz'an breaths acid on all players in front of him. Acid Breath inflicts $34268s1 Nature damage and an additional $34268s2 Nature damage every $34268t2 sec. for $34268d." },
          { id=6010, title="Thrash", parent=0, child=0, sib=6011, order=2, spell=0, icon="Interface\\icons\\ability_ghoulfrenzy", flags=0, cdisp=0,
